---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import logo from "../assets/svg/logo-arianna-milano.svg";
import hero from "../assets/images/ying-hero-wide.png";
import wordmark from "../assets/images/ying-wordmark-underline.png";
import preparation from "../assets/images/discipline-placeholder.png";
import portrait from "../assets/images/Ying_profile.png";
import panorama from "../assets/images/ying-footer-panorama-v2.png";
---

<BaseLayout title="Yīng · Aquila | Arianna Milano" description="Yīng significa aquila: il nome scelto da Arianna per accompagnarla sul tatami, un allenamento alla volta.">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main" data-interactive>Vai al contenuto</a>
  <main class="ying-page" id="main">
    <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="ying-title">
      <header class="site-head">
        <a href="/" data-interactive aria-label="Arianna Milano — Home"><img src={logo.src} alt="Arianna Milano" width={logo.width} height={logo.height} /></a>
        <nav id="ying-navigation" aria-label="Navigazione principale">
          <a href="/profilo/" data-interactive>Profilo</a><a href="/ying/" data-interactive aria-current="page">Yīng</a><a href="/risultati/" data-interactive>Risultati</a><a href="/media/" data-interactive>Media</a>
        </nav>
        <button class="site-head__menu" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ying-navigation" aria-label="Apri il menu" data-interactive><i></i><i></i><i></i></button>
      </header>
      <img class="hero__art" src={hero.src} alt="Illustrazione pittorica di un'aquila in volo" width={hero.width} height={hero.height} fetchpriority="high" />
      <div class="hero__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero__content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Il mio nome sul tatami</p>
        <div class="wordmark" aria-label="Ying, aquila">
          <h1 id="ying-title"><img src={wordmark.src} alt="Yīng" width={wordmark.width} height={wordmark.height} /></h1>
          <p><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Aquila<span aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__claim">Guardo. Scelgo. Provo.</p>
        <div class="hero__intro"><p>Yīng significa aquila. Ho scelto questo nome perché mi ricorda di osservare bene, restare concentrata e avere il coraggio di provare.</p><p>Quando entro sul tatami cerco di non avere fretta. Guardo chi ho davanti, ascolto il mio maestro e provo a capire quale sia il momento giusto per muovermi.</p><p>Non sempre riesce tutto al primo colpo, ed è normale. Ogni errore può insegnarmi qualcosa: respiro, riparto e provo di nuovo con più attenzione.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="meaning" aria-labelledby="meaning-title">
      <div class="meaning__visual"><img src={portrait.src} alt="Arianna osserva il tatami prima dell’allenamento" width={portrait.width} height={portrait.height} loading="lazy" /><span>Attenzione prima dell’azione</span></div>
      <div class="meaning__copy content-pad">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--red">Cosa significa per me</p>
        <h2 id="meaning-title">Prima guardo.<br /><em>Poi mi muovo.</em></h2>
        <p>Mi piace l’idea dell’aquila che osserva dall’alto e capisce dove andare. Non è soltanto forza: è attenzione, pazienza e capacità di scegliere il momento giusto.</p>
        <p>Durante un incontro provo a fare la stessa cosa. Guardo chi ho davanti, ascolto il mio maestro e cerco di restare presente. Yīng mi ricorda proprio questo.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="choice" aria-labelledby="choice-title">
      <div class="choice__copy content-pad">
        <p class="eyebrow">Perché l’ho scelto</p>
        <h2 id="choice-title">Un nome che cresce<br /><em>insieme a me.</em></h2>
        <p>Yīng non racconta una persona perfetta o invincibile. Racconta il modo in cui voglio affrontare le cose: con attenzione, impegno e fiducia.</p>
        <p>Ci sono allenamenti in cui mi sento forte e altri in cui devo ricominciare da capo. In entrambi i casi posso imparare qualcosa, anche da un errore.</p>
        <p>È questo che mi piace del Sanda: ogni volta posso conoscere meglio le mie capacità e fare un piccolo passo avanti.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="choice__image"><img src={preparation.src} alt="Arianna prepara le fasce prima dell’allenamento" width={preparation.width} height={preparation.height} loading="lazy" /></div>
    </section>

    <section class="journey" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
      <img src={panorama.src} alt="Una giovane atleta osserva le montagne al tramonto mentre un’aquila vola in lontananza" width={panorama.width} height={panorama.height} loading="lazy" />
      <div class="journey__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Essere Yīng</p>
        <h2 id="journey-title">Continuare a imparare.</h2>
        <p>Con impegno, curiosità e il coraggio di riprovare.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const menu = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.site-head__menu');
  const navigation = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#ying-navigation');
  menu?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const open = menu.getAttribute('aria-expanded') !== 'true';
    menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    menu.setAttribute('aria-label', open ? 'Chiudi il menu' : 'Apri il menu');
    navigation?.classList.toggle('is-open', open);
  });
</script>

<style>
  :global(body){background:#060605}.ying-page{--ink:#080706;--panel:#12100e;--paper:#eee7dc;--gold:#c49a54;--red:#a4201b;--soft:#bdb3a5;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
  .site-head{position:absolute;z-index:5;inset:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:88px;padding:0 clamp(22px,4vw,64px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(238,231,220,.12)}.site-head img{display:block;width:174px;height:auto}.site-head nav{display:flex;gap:28px}.site-head nav a{position:relative;padding:34px 0;color:rgba(238,231,220,.72);font:800 .62rem/1 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}.site-head nav a:after{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:25px;left:0;height:1px;background:var(--red);transform:scaleX(0);content:""}.site-head nav a:hover,.site-head nav a:focus-visible,.site-head nav [aria-current=page]{color:#fff}.site-head nav [aria-current=page]:after{transform:scaleX(1)}.site-head__menu{display:none;border:0;background:transparent}.site-head__menu i{display:block;width:24px;height:1px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--gold)}
  .hero{position:relative;min-height:clamp(900px,100svh,980px);isolation:isolate}.hero__art{position:absolute;z-index:-3;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:72% center}.hero__shade{position:absolute;z-index:-2;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,5,4,.12),rgba(5,5,4,.78) 43%,rgba(5,5,4,.05) 73%),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,5,4,.12) 55%,#080706 100%)}.hero__content{width:min(620px,43vw);padding-top:clamp(155px,19vh,220px);margin-left:clamp(36px,7.4vw,118px);padding-bottom:80px}.eyebrow{margin:0;color:var(--gold);font:800 .66rem/1.2 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase}.eyebrow--red{color:var(--red)}
  .wordmark{display:inline-grid;margin-top:28px;justify-items:start}.wordmark h1{margin:0;line-height:0}.wordmark h1 img{display:block;width:clamp(250px,22vw,340px);height:auto}.wordmark>p{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:20px 0 0;color:#f0bd57;font:800 .65rem/1 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.38em;text-transform:uppercase}.wordmark>p span{width:32px;height:1px;background:rgba(240,189,87,.72)}.hero__claim{margin:38px 0 0;color:#fff;font:600 clamp(1.9rem,2.6vw,2.7rem)/1.12 Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif}.hero__intro{max-width:58ch;margin:22px 0 0;color:var(--soft);font:400 1rem/1.65 var(--font-body)}.hero__intro p{margin:0 0 12px}
  .content-pad{padding:clamp(80px,9vw,140px) clamp(28px,7vw,108px)}.meaning{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;min-height:720px;background:var(--paper);color:#17130f}.meaning h2,.choice h2,.values h2{margin:30px 0 40px;font:500 clamp(3.2rem,5.6vw,6rem)/.94 Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;letter-spacing:-.04em}.meaning h2 em,.values h2 em{color:var(--red);font-style:normal}.meaning__copy>p:not(.eyebrow),.choice__copy>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:52ch;margin:0 0 18px;color:#544b41;font:400 1rem/1.7 var(--font-body)}.meaning__copy{align-self:center}.meaning__visual{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#d5c8b6}.meaning__visual img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:72% center;filter:grayscale(1) sepia(.2) contrast(.95)}.meaning__visual:after{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 70%,var(--paper));content:""}.meaning__visual span{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:36px;bottom:36px;color:#fff;font:800 .58rem/1 var(--font-ui);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .choice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:780px;background:var(--panel)}.choice__image{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#12100e}.choice__image:after{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(270deg,rgba(8,7,6,.03),rgba(18,16,14,.34) 100%);content:""}.choice__image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(1) sepia(.12) brightness(.55) contrast(1.12)}.choice__copy{align-self:center}.choice h2 em{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal}.choice__copy>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#b5aa9d}
  .journey{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#050607}.journey>img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.journey:after{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(3,3,3,.9),rgba(3,3,3,.36) 40%,transparent 70%);content:""}.journey__copy{position:absolute;z-index:1;top:50%;left:clamp(28px,6vw,96px);max-width:470px;transform:translateY(-50%)}.journey__copy h2{margin:22px 0 16px;color:#f5eee3;font:500 clamp(2.4rem,4.2vw,4.8rem)/.98 Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;letter-spacing:-.04em}.journey__copy>p:last-child{max-width:38ch;margin:0;color:rgba(245,238,227,.76);font:400 1rem/1.6 var(--font-body)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.site-head{height:68px;padding:0 18px}.site-head img{width:140px}.site-head nav{position:absolute;top:68px;right:0;left:0;display:none;gap:0;flex-direction:column;padding:10px 20px 18px;background:rgba(5,5,4,.97);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(196,154,84,.25)}.site-head nav.is-open{display:flex}.site-head nav a{padding:15px 0}.site-head nav a:after{bottom:7px}.site-head__menu{display:block;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 10px}.hero{min-height:900px;padding-top:0}.hero__art{position:absolute;z-index:-3;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;aspect-ratio:auto;object-fit:cover;object-position:66% center}.hero__shade{position:absolute;z-index:-2;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,5,4,.92),rgba(5,5,4,.58) 66%,rgba(5,5,4,.18)),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,5,4,.05) 48%,var(--ink) 100%)}.hero__content{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;width:100%;max-width:430px;margin:0;padding:138px 20px 70px}.hero__content>.eyebrow{text-align:left}.wordmark{display:grid;width:max-content;max-width:100%;margin:22px 0 0;justify-items:start}.wordmark h1 img{width:min(76vw,300px)}.wordmark>p{margin-top:10px}.hero__claim{margin-top:30px;font-size:1.82rem}.hero__intro{font-size:.97rem;line-height:1.58}.meaning,.choice{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);min-height:0}.meaning>* , .choice>*{min-width:0}.meaning__visual{min-height:0}.meaning__visual img{height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:#d5c8b6}.meaning__visual:after{background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 62%,var(--paper))}.meaning__visual span{left:20px;bottom:20px}.content-pad{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;width:100%;padding:62px 20px 76px}.meaning h2,.choice h2,.values h2{font-size:2.85rem}.meaning__copy>p:not(.eyebrow),.choice__copy>p:not(.eyebrow),.values article p{font-size:1rem}.choice__image{order:-1;height:auto}.choice__image img{height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:contain;background:#12100e}.choice__image:after{background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 70%,var(--panel))}.values{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;width:100%;padding:72px 20px 0}.values__head{display:block;min-width:0}.values__list{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);margin-top:48px}.values article,.values article:first-child{min-width:0;padding:28px 0;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(83,62,36,.18)}.values article:last-child{border:0}.values article span{width:30px;height:30px}.values article span:after{margin:10px}.values__panorama{margin:30px -20px 0}.values__panorama img{aspect-ratio:auto;object-fit:contain}.values__panorama figcaption{right:20px;left:20px;bottom:20px;font-size:1.35rem}}
  @media(max-width:390px){.hero__content,.content-pad{padding-right:16px;padding-left:16px}.wordmark h1 img{width:min(78vw,280px)}.wordmark>p{gap:9px;font-size:.58rem}.wordmark>p span{width:22px}.hero__claim{font-size:1.62rem}.meaning h2,.choice h2,.values h2{font-size:2.2rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.values{padding-right:16px;padding-left:16px}.values__panorama{margin-right:-16px;margin-left:-16px}.meaning__copy>p:not(.eyebrow),.choice__copy>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}}
  @media(max-width:760px){.journey{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.journey>img{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%;height:auto}.journey:after{display:none}.journey__copy{position:static;max-width:none;padding:34px 20px 40px;transform:none;background:#050607}.journey__copy h2{font-size:2.45rem}.journey__copy>p:last-child{font-size:1rem}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
